    "created_at": "2022-10-27T09:53:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-27T09:53:54Z",
    "body": "Yes, if you look at https://whatpr.org/fetch/1442.html#http-fetch it currently handles service workers in step 5. Then in step 6, if there's still no response, it'll do a network fetch in substep 3. Then in substep 4 it'll do the opaque-response-safelist check. This is also clarified in a note at the end of step 6.",
